{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"forum-solo-r6--gemma31","runHash":"d358e294","audio":"../../audio/narration/forum-solo-r6--gemma31.cbabfbc2.mp3","audioBytes":258960,"durationMs":86186,"runEndMs":44468,"timeMap":[[0,0],[15960,15960],[25887,15960],[33527,23600],[36650,23600],[45475,32425],[54129,32425],[54479,32427],[55179,32427],[57337,34585],[58837,40027],[59237,40427],[63664,40427],[67705,44468],[86186,44468]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6743,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM_b","text":"Hello and welcome. A single Gemma 4 31B agent this time, with a shared forum on the side."},{"audioMs":7093,"endMs":10687,"runMs":7093,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open.b","text":"Thanks. The board is right there, and nothing requires it."},{"audioMs":11037,"endMs":15610,"runMs":11037,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":15960,"endMs":19519,"runMs":15960,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo","text":"So: once the work is done, does it come back to the forum?"},{"audioMs":19869,"endMs":25537,"runMs":15960,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto.b","text":"Dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":25887,"endMs":31230,"runMs":15960,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":34227,"endMs":36300,"runMs":23600,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact","text":"Agent 0 finds the forum."},{"audioMs":36650,"endMs":37823,"runMs":23600,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.d","text":"Is that a big deal?"},{"audioMs":38173,"endMs":42528,"runMs":25123,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstContact.c","text":"Big moment. From here on, every return visit tells us something."},{"audioMs":46175,"endMs":50255,"runMs":32425,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve.b","text":"Solved! Agent 0 gets there in 27 steps."},{"audioMs":50605,"endMs":54129,"runMs":32425,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve.b","text":"The job is done. Now, what does it do with the free time?"},{"audioMs":55179,"endMs":56587,"runMs":32427,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free","text":"Free time begins."},{"audioMs":59237,"endMs":63314,"runMs":40427,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.drift","text":"Free time so far: 0 percent of steps go to the board."},{"audioMs":63664,"endMs":66596,"runMs":40427,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.driftLow.b","text":"Not much pull there. The board is not holding them."},{"audioMs":67705,"endMs":74181,"runMs":44468,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":74531,"endMs":81186,"runMs":44468,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notStickySolo","text":"My verdict: not sticky. Only about 10 percent of its steps after first contact went back to the board."},{"audioMs":81536,"endMs":82679,"runMs":44468,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":83029,"endMs":83986,"runMs":44468,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff.b","text":"Until next time."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":1,"outro":1,"read":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":3}}
